            "Solar, HVAC, antenna, skylight, or other penetration involved",
            "Emergency tarp, seal, drain clearing, or temporary work occurred"
          ],
          "guidance": "Checking an indicator records its presence or report; it is not a cause or coverage conclusion."
        },
